Subject: [PATCH 4/7] Cherry-pick 321880@main (caff9f3583a8).
 https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=325140

    ANGLE: Build WebGPU backend if ENABLE_WEBGL_WEBGPU is passed to build
    https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=325140
    rdar://188274494

    Reviewed by Dan Glastonbury and Mike Wyrzykowski.

    Build ANGLE WebGPU backend:
      build-webkit --cmake --debug --cmakeargs="-DENABLE_WEBGL_WEBGPU=ON"

    Or:
      echo "ENABLE_WEBGL_WEBGPU = YES" >> LocalOverrides.xcconfig
      make debug

    Only builds the backend and links with empty WebGPU integration.
    Tests can be run once WebGPU.framework is fixed enough.
    Browser can run once proc table is filled with the IPC implementation.

